    "ledger-hscroll.test.cjs": "C9 ordinary detail order/duplicate label conflict corrected171; per-action history reads now explicit. Final remaining failure is only upstream WebKit a bar with nothing to scroll. Assertion124 maps to pristine120 after4 fixture assertion lines; same failure also reproduced in official baseline and final images.",
