    "plugin-pick-sub.test.cjs": "Unchanged plugin UI has a providers-read race: card first says Installed before Sign in. Unmodified baseline3green retained. Controlled300ms providers delay reproduces same assertion on pristine upstream9cases and candidate10cases; no source patch to plugin install/sign-in.",
    "plugin-readme-bird.test.cjs": "Same upstream bird-motion assertion and low animation counts; numbers vary per run. Unchanged plugin/animation implementation.",
