    "routing-ctx-sessions.test.cjs": "Same upstream frame-count assertion125; baseline6frames,candidate9,retry6. No change to renderer/frame loop.",
    "routing-idle-frame.test.cjs": "Same upstream wake-loop assertion151; frames per600ms vary6/7/10. No change to renderer/frame loop.",
    "routing-many-keys.test.cjs": "Pristine baseline and two additional baseline runs fail adjacent footer virtual-list assertion187 (one/two keys in sight); candidate initially fails last-key assertion186, retry fails187 as baseline. No fork delta in virtual-list painter; no explicit Usage navigation in fixture. Do not claim exact initial assertion reproduction.",
